  "description": "The WHEN MONTHLYI arm at :213-238 with CONFIRMI = 'Y', pinned on a THIRTY-day month, which is the third distinct month length the composite has to produce. The month end is derived exactly as :229-230 derives it - FUNCTION DATE-OF-INTEGER of FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE minus one, applied to the first day of the following month - and both dates are asserted where they are observable: in records 11, 12 and 15 of the emitted stream. Expected values are STATICALLY DERIVED by reading app/cbl/CORPT00C.cbl, its copybooks, app/bms/CORPT00.bms and app/csd/CARDDEMO.CSD - never captured from a COBOL run, which is impossible in this environment (risk R-A). Java has no transient data queue, so EXEC CICS WRITEQ TD QUEUE('JOBS') at :517 is reproduced through an explicit job-submission port; the eighty-byte content is identical and the dataset key JOBS names the TDQUEUE(JOBS) that app/csd/CARDDEMO.CSD:499-505 defines as RECORDSIZE(80) RECORDFORMAT(FIXED) BLOCKFORMAT(UNBLOCKED) DISPOSITION(MOD).",
